{"mangaRefs":[],"locationRefs":[],"summary":{"en":"Eri Kisaki is asked to defend Hiroaki Takeuchi who had been accused of hit-and-run incident. However, the evidence suggests it was his wife, Mariko Takeuchi, who has committed the crime. Hiroaki calls Reiko Kujo and tells her to meet him and he will tell her the truth. Reiko, accompanied by Mariko, visits Hiroaki and sees him fall off his balcony to his death. Believing her questioning motivated his suicide, Reiko quits her job as a prosecutor.","zhHans":"围绕水无怜奈、CIA、FBI和组织行动展开的长期情报战。","zhHant":"","legacy":true,"sourcePage":"Courtroom_Confrontation_III__Prosecutor_as_Eyewitness","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-ran-mouri","character-kogoro-mouri","character-conan-edogawa","character-miwako-sato","character-midori-kuriyama","character-wataru-takagi","character-eri-kisaki","character-reiko-kujo"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":[],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime","src-detective-conan-world-bo-timeline","src-detective-conan-world-cia"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"動畫原創","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":488,"dcwMangaSource":"TV Original","dcwMangaKind":"anime-original","dcwAirDate":"November 26, 2007"},"season":12,"solvedByRaw":"Kogoro Mouri (via Conan)","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Eri Kisaki","Reiko Kujo","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri","Midori Kuriyama","Miwako Sato","Wataru Takagi","Sasaki","Presiding judge","Side judge A","Side judge B"],"dcwL3Source":{"season":"Courtroom_Confrontation_III__Prosecutor_as_Eyewitness","characters":"Courtroom_Confrontation_III__Prosecutor_as_Eyewitness"},"solvedBy":"character-kogoro-mouri","solvedByParsedFrom":"Kogoro Mouri (via Conan)"}